              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ido kitodolikinai naiwadikatai nainera ebe, “Kiyuu Aburaam Edeke, kimarakinai araut adolit”; komaikinai epapero loka Edeke. ",
          "type": "text",
